# Rofellos, Llanowar Emissary counts the Forests its controller controls as the ability resolves (CR 605.1a, 106.4), possibly none:
# Bot1's only land is an Island, so tapping Rofellos adds no mana at all, while Bot2's Forest is not Bot1's to count.
# Black Lotus pays for Rofellos on turn 1; its third green mana empties from the pool long before turn 3.

